# AI coding-agent skills (installed user-globally at ~/.claude/skills/
# or via `npx skills add ...`). Ignore both the universal `.agents/`
# install layout AND the Claude Code symlink dir `.claude/skills/`
# so a project-local skill install never lands in git.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
skills-lock.json